{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kill Your Heart",
    "steam_appid": 3604470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/81d2f885c82ee307584635face07a992.avif?t=1743398698\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Cupid Island\u2014a sun-kissed paradise where love should bloom\u2014unrequited affection turns into a curse, twisting broken hearts into grotesque monsters. With its inhabitants too afraid to let their guards down, you step up as the reluctant mediator, striving to unite fragile souls. You\u2019ll weave through the island\u2019s vibrant hotspots, dodging threats to deliver desperate confessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/77be700825b55d500d04032182c8f2dd.avif?t=1743398698\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolver Time Battle</strong>: Wield a firearm in tense, timed showdowns\u2014spin it, aim true, and fire with purpose to take down twisted creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror experience</strong>: Resources are scarce\u2014search for keys, manage what little you find, and solve cryptic puzzles to push ahead. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG depth</strong>: Build your strength over time\u2014unlock new skills to turn fights around and find gear that keeps you alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Tale</strong>: Unravel a story that\u2019s tragic, absurd, and oddly funny\u2014full of surreal moments that stick like a fleeting dream.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Beauty</strong>: Rich, vibrant pixel art brings every monster and moment to life with a gritty, retro charm.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stirring Music</strong>: Listen to an electric soundtrack that will make your heart skip a beat.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/81d2f885c82ee307584635face07a992.avif?t=1743398698\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Cupid Island\u2014a sun-kissed paradise where love should bloom\u2014unrequited affection turns into a curse, twisting broken hearts into grotesque monsters. With its inhabitants too afraid to let their guards down, you step up as the reluctant mediator, striving to unite fragile souls. You\u2019ll weave through the island\u2019s vibrant hotspots, dodging threats to deliver desperate confessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/77be700825b55d500d04032182c8f2dd.avif?t=1743398698\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolver Time Battle</strong>: Wield a firearm in tense, timed showdowns\u2014spin it, aim true, and fire with purpose to take down twisted creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror experience</strong>: Resources are scarce\u2014search for keys, manage what little you find, and solve cryptic puzzles to push ahead. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG depth</strong>: Build your strength over time\u2014unlock new skills to turn fights around and find gear that keeps you alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Tale</strong>: Unravel a story that\u2019s tragic, absurd, and oddly funny\u2014full of surreal moments that stick like a fleeting dream.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Beauty</strong>: Rich, vibrant pixel art brings every monster and moment to life with a gritty, retro charm.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stirring Music</strong>: Listen to an electric soundtrack that will make your heart skip a beat.</p></li></ul>",
